{
  "key": 19259,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 39\n",
        "South to Olivine City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Moomoo Farm\n",
        "Enjoy Our Fresh and Tasty Milk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "Use Headbutt on trees to shake\n",
        "Pokémon out.\r",
        "Different kinds of Pokémon drop out\n",
        "of trees.\r",
        "Use Headbutt on any tree you see!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00003",
      "en_US": "Miltank: Mooo!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Baoba: ...Ohh!\n",
        "What you are holding is...\f",
        "what they call...a Pokédex!\f",
        "Haven’t seen one of those in ages.\r",
        "My name is Baoba!\r",
        "I used to run a Safari Zone in\n",
        "Fuchsia City, but it was becoming\f",
        "out of date with new entertainment\f",
        "options coming out.\r",
        "I decided to go overseas to learn\n",
        "the newest technology and open a\f",
        "state-of-the-art Safari Zone\f",
        "in Cianwood.\r",
        "It may be more than a coincidence\n",
        "that we are chatting.\r",
        "Why don’t we register each other’s\n",
        "numbers in the Pokégear?\r",
        "I can give you a call once the Safari\n",
        "Zone is open before I call anyone else!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00005",
      "en_US": "Do you want to register? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00006",
      "en_US": "That’s the way!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh, I didn’t expect you to say no.\n",
        "You can get hard-to-find Pokémon, too.\r",
        "You’ll be able to make good progress\n",
        "with your Pokédex, too...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Baoba\n",
        "in the Pokégear!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Baoba: I’ll let you know over the\n",
        "Pokégear once it’s ready!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Hey, you!\r",
        "Don’t you want a good memory of us\n",
        "together? How about taking a\f",
        "picture with me? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: OK! OK!\r",
        "Show me a very good smile!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Wow!\n",
        "This turned out to be a really\f",
        "good one!\r",
        "We root for Route 39!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: That’s OK...\r",
        "Let me know if you change your mind."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Photo Album is full.\r",
        "Access your PC to delete some pictures\n",
        "before you come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Left step, right step, hop twice...\n",
        "No, that’s not it!\r",
        "Move to the left, move to the right,\n",
        "criss-cross...\r",
        "No! That’s wrong too!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Gah! You scared me.\r",
        "You heard me trying to form dance\n",
        "moves, huh?\r",
        "I could really do with inspiration...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "I bet if I were to see the graceful\n",
        "dancing of a {COLOR 2}Bellossom{COLOR 0}, I’d know\f",
        "exactly what to do!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, wow! That’s a Bellossom behind\n",
        "you, isn’t it?\r",
        "Can you please ask it to\n",
        "dance for me? I’d appreciate it! {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "You won’t?\r",
        "...\r",
        "I was really hoping you would..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00020",
      "en_US": "Yes! Thank you so much!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "That did the trick! I definitely feel\n",
        "a lot more inspired now. I can’t thank\f",
        "you enough!\r",
        "Here, this TM should be useful\n",
        "for your Bellossom!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00022",
      "en_US": "Oh!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "While I was walking around here,\n",
        "I found this weird cuboid object on\f",
        "the ground.\r",
        "I don’t know what it is, but it\n",
        "feels somehow valuable.\r",
        "I’d like you to have it!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0396_R39_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you for everything.\n",
        "Bye-bye!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
